          "en": "He looks like a great lion, with a red face, a golden crown and a long white beard."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dos bailarines se mueven dentro de él, uno adelante y otro atrás.",
          "en": "Two dancers move inside him, one at the front and one at the back."
        },
        {
          "es": "Algunos lo llaman Banaspati Raja, el señor del bosque.",
          "en": "Some call him Banaspati Raja, the lord of the forest."
